-- תחום תנאי שירות עובדי הוראה — טבלת שכר
-- The department's salary-table page: a summary of the salary composition
-- for teachers outside Ofek Hadash (updated to June 2015), which says of
-- itself that it is published for convenience only and that the agreements
-- prevail, and a list of the salary tables it links to. A web page of the
-- department, not part of the takanon: nothing of it is encoded as a rule.

IMPORT prelude

§ `טבלת שכר`

-- akn:hc_1 The portal's breadcrumb and the page title; no rule.
-- akn:hc_2 The salary-composition summary (June 2015): by its own words a non-binding convenience summary that the existing instructions and collective agreements override, with a contact line and the titles of its three parts; no rule, and its figures are not encoded.
-- akn:hc_3 The page's list of its parts (certified, uncertified, instructor grade, upper-division and Ofek Hadash tables); navigation, no rule.
-- akn:hc_4 akn:hc_5 akn:hc_6 Titles of the salary tables by date, for certified and uncertified teachers and the instructor grade; links to tables, no rule.
-- akn:att_4__hc_1 akn:att_7__hc_1 akn:att_19__hc_1 Titles of the Ofek Hadash salary tables, the 2022 Ofek supplement and the deputies' tables; links to tables, no rule.
